\\n        sources=[\\\\n    \\n.codex/session_parts/01a03d78-e8fd-7022-a4fa-9510f9e8f4df/part-0002:79: trailing whitespace.\\n+{\\\"timestamp\\\":\\\"2026-08-26T09:52:52.188Z\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"response_item\\\",\\\"payload\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"custom_tool_call_output\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"ctco_01a03d7c-9ddc-7c50-b73a-485ecc60c287\\\",\\\"call_id\\\":\\\"call_NMi2amjkvMp5dFCScRVt6o2k\\\",\\\"output\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"Script completed\\\\nWall time 0.1 seconds\\\\nOutput:\\\\n\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"input_text\\\",\\\"text\\\":\\\"scripts/serving/client/azure_code.sh\\\\nscripts/serving/client/azure_conv.sh\\\\nscripts/serving/client/mixed_code.sh\\\\nscripts/serving/client/mixed_conv.sh\\\\nscripts/serving/client/offline_throughput.sh\\\\nscripts/serving/client/prettify_result.py\\\\nscripts/serving/client/sharegpt.sh\\\\nscripts/serving/client/swaped_azure_code.sh\\\\nscripts/serving/client/swaped_azure_conv.sh\\\\nscripts/serving/model_map.sh\\\\nscripts/serving/run_experiment.sh\\\\nscripts/serving/run_experiment_tmux.sh\\\\n# Serving 실행 가이드\\\\n\\\\nOpenAI-compatible server의 기준 진입점은 `serve_offload_kvweight.py`다.\\\\n이 launcher가 tiered 환경을 engine 생성 전에 고정하고 patched vLLM의\\\\n`run_server()`를 시작한다. Startup과 request별 내부 순서는\\\\n[Inference 수행 흐름](INFERENCE_FLOW.md)을 사용한다.\\\\n\\\\n모든 명령은 저장소 루트에서 실행한다.\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\ncd /root/projects/tiered-serve\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## 0. LD_PRELOAD: CPython frame-stack mmap/munmap 제거\\\\n\\\\nCPython 3.12은 interpreter frame data-stack을 16 KiB 단위로\\\\n`mmap(MAP_ANONYMOUS)`/`munmap`으로 할당·해제한다. vLLM V1의 깊은\\\\nper-piece call chain(~80 layer × 4 projection)이 이 경계를 반복적으로\\\\n넘어 nsys에서 step당 수천 회의 `mmap64`/`munmap`을 발생시킨다.\\\\n\\\\n`etc/stack_pool.so`는 `mmap64`/`munmap`을 가로채서 16 KiB chunk를\\\\nfree-list pool로 재사용한다. 반환 시 `memset`으로 zeroing하여\\\\n`MAP_ANONYMOUS`의 zeroed-page 계약을 보존한다. 이로써 step당\\\\nmmap/munmap을 0으로 만든다.\\\\n\\\\n**모든 실행 명령에 `LD_PRELOAD`를 붙인다.**\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n`.so` 빌드 방법은 [구조 가이드의 Tips](LANDING_GUIDE.md#6-tips)를\\\\n참고한다.\\\\n\\\\n## 1. 시작 전 확인\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\nnvidia-smi\\\\nfindmnt -no TARGET,FSTYPE,OPTIONS /mnt/hugepages\\\\ntest -w /mnt/hugepages\\\\ncat /sys/kernel/mm/hugepages/hugepages-16777216kB/nr_hugepages\\\\ncat /sys/kernel/mm/hugepages/hugepages-16777216kB/free_hugepages\\\\n\\\\n./.venv/bin/python - <<'PY'\\\\nimport torch\\\\nimport vllm\\\\nimport tiered_serve\\\\n\\\\nprint(\\\\\\\"vllm:\\\\\\\", vllm.__file__)\\\\nprint(\\\\\\\"tiered_serve:\\\\\\\", tiered_serve.__file__)\\\\nprint(\\\\\\\"cuda:\\\\\\\", torch.cuda.is_available())\\\\nPY\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nGH200 CUDA가 보여야 하며 `/mnt/hugepages`는 16 GiB hugetlbfs `rw` mount여야\\\\n하고 현재 사용자에게 쓰기 권한이 있어야 한다. Total/free page는 weight\\\\nreservation(70B 14장, 8B 2장)보다 커야 하며 원하는 KV capacity만큼의 page가\\\\n추가로 남아야 한다. 모델 checkpoint/tokenizer는 local cache에 있거나\\\\nnetwork와 Hugging Face 인증으로 받을 수 있어야 한다. Sibling patch와 native\\\\nABI 확인은 [구조 가이드](LANDING_GUIDE.md)를 따른다.\\\\n\\\\n## 2. Server 시작\\\\n\\\\n### 2.1 70B fused weight + KV compression\\\\n\\\\n`all-frozen-split-p4`와 `--fused-mm`을 함께 쓰면 P4Flat weight override를\\\\n실제로 설치하면서 KV offload/compression도 사용하는 70B profile이 된다.\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\nLD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\\\\\\\\\\nnumactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python serve_offload_kvweight.py \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --model meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --weight-comp p4flat \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --fused-mm \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --kv-comp p4flat \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --ts-configs cao-p4-fused \\\\\\\\\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nWeight placement을 바꾸고 싶다면 다음 profile을 사용한다.\\\\n\\\\n| 모델 | Config | Weight 실행 |\\\\n|---|---|---|\\\\n| 70B | `flexgen` | even HBM + odd raw weight offload |\\\\n| 70B | `flexgen-comp-p4` | even HBM + odd P4Flat weight offload + dense decompress |\\\\n| 70B | `all-frozen-split-p4` | `--fused-mm` 사용 시 P4Flat split-storage override |\\\\n\\\\nRaw config에서는 `--weight-comp p4flat`과 `--fused-mm`을 빼고, KV compression을 끄려면\\\\n`--kv-comp p4flat`만 뺀다. KV offload까지 끄려면 두 번째 변경과 함께\\\\n`--no-offload-kv`를 추가한다. `--no-offload-kv --kv-comp ...` 조합은\\\\n허용되지 않는다.\\\\n\\\\nWeight placement는 CLI가 아니라 YAML residency가 결정한다. `--weight-comp`\\\\n또는 `--kv-comp`는 값을 생략하면 `zipserv`, flag 자체를 생략하면 OFF다.\\\\n`--ts-configs`는 필수이고 여러 값을 주면 첫 config가 primary env/log stem이\\\\n된다. `--fused-mm`은 weight-only 요청이며 compression을 켜지 않는다. KV는\\\\nraw 또는 compressed LPDDR에서 dense HBM으로 복원된 뒤 FlashAttention이 읽는다.\\\\n\\\\n## 3. Launcher가 고정하는 값\\\\n\\\\nServing CLI의 일부 vLLM 옵션은 launcher가 engine 생성 직전에 다음처럼\\\\n고정한다.\\\\n\\\\n| Engine 값 | Serving 동작 |\\\\n|---|---|\\\\n| Process topology | API frontend와 EngineCore child 분리; child 안은 `UniProcExecutor` |\\\\n| `block_size` | `16` |\\\\n| `swap_space` | `0` |\\\\n| `enforce_eager` | `False` |\\\\n| `max_model_len` | `--max-context-len` |\\\\n| `max_num_batched_tokens` | chunked prefill이면 `8192`, 아니면 context length |\\\\n| `max_num_seqs` | 요청값, 미지정 시 `512`, 최대 `512` |\\\\n| compile cache | 매 run 비활성화 |\\\\n| request body logging | 비활성화 |\\\\n| KV staging buffers | `2` |\\\\n\\\\n따라서 context는 `--max-context-len`, concurrency는 `--max-num-seqs`,\\\\nprefill 정책은 `--chunked-prefill` 또는 `--no-chunked-prefill`로 설정한다.\\\\n지원 기준은 BF16, TP=1, prefix caching off다.\\\\n\\\\n### 3.1 Dedicated KV block 계산\\\\n\\\\n`TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS`와\\\\n`TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_SIZE_GB`를 모두 unset하면 서버가 시작 시점의\\\\n가용 HBM, runtime reserve, resident-tail, LPDDR 용량을 기준으로 dedicated\\\\nKV block 수를 자동 계산한다.\\\\n\\\\n고정 비교가 필요할 때만 둘 중 하나를 설정한다. `BLOCKS` 값은 scheduler가\\\\n보는 논리 KV block 수이며 resident-tail row는 내부에서 별도로 더한다. 명시한\\\\n값이 HBM 한도를 넘으면 값이 조용히 줄어들지 않고 서버 시작이 실패하면서\\\\n요청값과 가능한 최댓값을 출력한다.\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\n# 자동 계산\\\\nunset TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS\\\\nunset TIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_SIZE_GB\\\\n\\\\n# 논리 KV block 수를 정확히 요청\\\\nTIERED_SERVE_DEDICATED_KV_BLOCKS=2432 \\\\\\\\\\\\n  LD_PRELOAD=/root/projects/tiered-serve/etc/stack_pool.so \\\\\\\\\\\\n  numactl -m 0 ./.venv/bin/python serve_offload_kvweight.py ...\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## 4. API smoke\\\\n\\\\nServer가 model load와 graph capture를 끝낸 뒤 별도 terminal에서 실행한다.\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\ncurl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8000/health\\\\ncurl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/models\\\\n\\\\ncurl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/chat/completions \\\\\\\\\\\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\\\\\\\\\\n  -d '{\\\\n    \\\\\\\"model\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"meta-llama/Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct\\\\\\\",\\\\n    \\\\\\\"messages\\\\\\\": [{\\\\\\\"role\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"user\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"content\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"What is the capital of France?\\\\\\\"}],\\\\n    \\\\\\\"temperature\\\\\\\": 0,\\\\n    \\\\\\\"max_tokens\\\\\\\": 16\\\\n  }'\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n8B server에는 request의 `model`도 8B ID로 바꾼다. `--served-model-name`을\\\\n사용했다면 그 alias를 넣는다. `/v1/completions`도 지원한다. `--api-key`를 사용했다면\\\\nOpenAI API 요청에 `Authorization: Bearer <key>` header를 추가한다. 외부\\\\n접속이 필요하지 않으면 `127.0.0.1` bind를 유지한다.\\\\n\\\\n## 5. Server-side logging\\\\n\\\\nLauncher log는 자동으로 다음 위치에 생긴다.\\\\n\\\\n```text\\\\nlogs/serving/<model-id>/<config>/<timestamp>/<max-context-len>.log\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n요청 구간의 server logging은 다음 endpoint로 제어한다.\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\ncurl -fsS -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/start_logging\\\\n\\\\n# workload 실행\\\\n\\\\ncurl -fsS -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/stop_logging \\\\\\\\\\\\n  -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\\\\\\\\\\n  -d '{\\\\\\\"prompt\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"manual\\\\\\\"}'\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n`<max-context-len>.log`는 항상 연결된 launcher log다. `/start_logging`은\\\\n응답으로 `engine_id`와 `log_dir`를 반환하고 workload 구간에 같은 directory의\\\\n`server.log` handler를 추가한다. `/stop_logging`의 `prompt` 값은 현재 파일명을\\\\n바꾸지 않는다.\\\\n\\\\n`--collect-time`은 endpoint와 독립적으로 startup부터 CUDA-event timing을 켜고\\\\n`<timestamp>_<engine-id>_collect_time.log`를 쓴다. Normal latency 비교에는\\\\n사용하지 않는다.\\\\n\\\\n## 6. Torch profiler\\\\n\\\\nProfiler endpoint는 `--profiler-config`를 준 server에만 생긴다.\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\nmkdir -p /tmp/tiered-serve-profile\\\\ncurl -fsS -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/start_profile\\\\n# workload 실행\\\\ncurl -fsS -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/stop_profile\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nServer 명령에는 다음 인자를 추가한다.\\\\n\\\\n```text\\\\n--profiler-config '{\\\\\\\"profiler\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"torch\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"torch_profiler_dir\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"/tmp/tiered-serve-profile\\\\\\\"}'\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nTrace는 `torch_profiler_dir`에 저장된다. Profiler, `--collect-time`, server\\\\nlogging은 서로 다른 기능이며 profiler와 collect-time에는 계측 overhead가 있다.\\\\n\\\\nAPI key middleware는 `/v1` request만 검사한다. `/health`, `/metrics`, docs,\\\\nlogging/profile endpoint 등 non-`/v1` 경로는 reverse proxy나 firewall에서\\\\n별도로 보호한다. `--host`를 생략하면 외부 interface에 bind될 수 있으므로 local\\\\n실험은 `127.0.0.1`을 명시한다.\\\\n\\\\n## 7. Client 실행\\\\n\\\\n```text\\\\nbash scripts/serving/client/azure_conv.sh <model-id> <config-id> <optinal: request-rate>\\\\n# ex) \\\\nbash scripts/serving/client/azure_conv.sh llama70b cao-p4-kvcomp 1.0\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## 8. 종료와 실험 wrapper\\\\n\\\\nForeground server는 `Ctrl-C`로 종료한다. Background 실행은 위 command의\\\\n마지막을 `--port 8000 > /tmp/tiered-serve.out 2>&1 &`로 바꾸고 즉시 PID를\\\\n저장한다.\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\nSERVER_PID=$!\\\\n\\\\n# workload가 끝난 뒤\\\\nkill -INT \\\\\\\"$SERVER_PID\\\\\\\"\\\\nwait \\\\\\\"$SERVER_PID\\\\\\\"\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nLauncher의 `finally`는 CUDA context가 살아 있을 때 C++ KV offload system을\\\\n명시적으로 shutdown한다. `SIGKILL`은 이 경로와 hugetlbfs file cleanup을\\\\n건너뛴다.\\\\n\\\\n`scripts/serving/run_experiment.sh`와\\\\n`scripts/serving/run_experiment_tmux.sh`는 고정된 model/config/client sweep용\\\\nwrapper다. 일반 server 기동에는 위 launcher 명령을 사용한다. 두 wrapper의\\\\n`PORT`는 health check에 쓰이지만 server `--port`로 전달되지 않아 8000 이외의\\\\n값은 직접 수정해야 한다. tmux wrapper는 timeout 뒤 `SIGKILL`, 이어서 container\\\\n안의 모든 Python process cleanup까지 수행하므로 공유 container에서는 실행하지\\\\n않는다.\\\\n\\\\n문제가 생기면 startup log에서 다음 순서로 확인한다.\\\\n\\\\n1. sibling vLLM import와 resolved weight residency\\\\n2. `##### Using Fused M